# Tilt's own scratch directory. The Tiltfile generates the chart's development
# values into it on every execution, and `helm(values=[...])` watches the files
# it is given — so without this the write triggers a reload that performs the
# write again, several times a second, forever.
#
# Nothing is lost by ignoring it: everything in here is derived, and the sources
# it is derived from (.env, the Tiltfile, chart/, k8s/) are watched already.
.tilt/

# Linked worktrees, which live in the repository. Each holds a full copy of the
# source Tilt watches, so without this a single edit in one worktree looks like a
# change to every other worktree's build context as well.
.worktrees/
